<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-VIEIRA RETURNS TO FRANCE UNDER-21 SIDE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VIEIRA RETURNS TO FRANCE UNDER-21 SIDE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arsenal midfielder Patrick Vieira, who made his full French international debut last week, is back in the under-21 team for the European championship group three match against Switzerland in Pau next Wednesday.</p>
<p>Winger Thierry Henry, who laid on Monaco's goal in their 1-0 away leg UEFA Cup quarter-final win over England's Newcastle United on Tuesday, is also in the squad.</p>
</text>
